
File Name: announcements_service.dart

1. Modification Done:

   * Added category fields on list/detail models (category, categoryLabel, authorRoleLabel, authorId).
   * Added fetchCategories(), fetchAnnouncements(category), submitContact().
   * Create/update announcements use category instead of author_role dropdown.

2. Purpose of This Modification:

   * Announcements v2: five categories, Contact Me for members, publisher badge on cards.

3. How This Modification Is Involved in the Flow:

   * Used by DashboardAnnouncementsScreen (filters, create/edit) and DashboardAnnouncementDetailScreen (Contact Me).
